<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">apiVersion: eventing.knative.dev</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#56B6C2;">/</span><span style="--shiki-light:#383A42;--shiki-dark:#ABB2BF;">v1</span></span>
